Transfers from the Treasury general fund to the Highway Trust Fund, billions of nominal dollars, transcribed
from CRS R48845, "Surface Transportation Reauthorization: Federal Highway Programs" (Sept 8, 2026), Table A-2
(reflects sequestration for FY2013 and FY2014):
https://www.congress.gov/crs_external_products/R/PDF/R48845/R48845.12.pdf
fiscal_year is the federal fiscal year (Oct-Sept) of the effective date; P.L. 112-141's general-fund amounts
are assigned to the fiscal years they were provided for. CRS R47573 gives $275.2B in all transfers including
non-general-fund sources; this table is general fund only ($271.5B).
